LangName: 1033 "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "Richard Westebbe" "Heldenlied Minuskel is a Carolingian minuscule typeface for the fantasy role-playing game Heldenlied +IBMA Das Schicksal der Helden. It is modelled on the Folchart Psalter, written in St. Gallen around 872." "https://heldenlied-rpg.de" "https://heldenlied-rpg.de" "This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. This license is available with a FAQ at: https://openfontlicense.org" "https://openfontlicense.org" "" "" "" "" "Heldenlied - the fate of heroes"
LangName: 1031 "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "Heldenlied Minuskel ist eine karolingische Minuskelschrift f+APwA-r das Fantasy-Rollenspiel Heldenlied +IBMA Das Schicksal der Helden. Als Vorlage diente der Folchart-Psalter (St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 23, entstanden um 872)" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "" "Heldenlied - Das Schicksal der Helden"
